// spec/engine/narrativeArc.md, "Story: Advance rolling arcs and publish phase-aware clues"; spec/engine/narrativeArc.md, "Story: Prepare private proofs and settle expired markets safely"; spec/engine/narrativeArc.md, "Expired markets prepare a private draft proof or enter manual review hold"; spec/engine/narrativeArc.md, "Only admins may approve or resolve markets on manual hold"; spec/engine/narrativeArc.md, "Inductive invariants for 10 slots, unique clues, and secret isolation"
